 of your day when you Brainstorm.The cursor now only turns into the pointing hand when you're hovering over the Casebook's navigation tabs - previously there was a glitch where if you moved the Casebook to the left side of the screen, the cu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T18:57:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498235212","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4742500-1842846814454354","game_id":"steam-4742500","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch: The Multi-Page Jotpad Has Arrived!","summary":"Hello investigators! Today's patch brings a few improvements aimed at making it easier to keep your thoughts and your notes sorted, plus a few little nice-to-haves.The Jotpad now supports multiple pages! Instead of one big pile of notes and quotes, you can now create and name an endless number of pages to separate out your thoughts as you're talking to the suspects. Better communication when nothing happens for a reason - if you try to drop a dialog line on a character that doesn't have an inter","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T01:02:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814454354","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4742500-1839676055896004","game_id":"steam-4742500","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Bugfixes and QOL Galore!","summary":"Hello investigators! We've been hard at work investigating the cause of weirdness and unexpected behaviour in the demo and now we've got a little patch for you!Today's update features:Jotpad \"start typing\" text duplication bug fixedCharacter name clipping in jotpad, casebook and world map fixedJotpad scrollbar overlapping the \"X\" to close button is fixedRepaired some broken linkages for followup questions for some Lillian dialog linesFixed the Casebook not remembering the search term you had app","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T22:25:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055896004","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4742500-1839676055882922","game_id":"steam-4742500","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - Typos, Casebook Notifications, Bugfixes!","summary":"Hello investigators! Today we have for you another small update to the demo, including:Typo FixesWe've fixed a handful of little typos in the dialog (woops!) and are always on the lookout for more. Don't be shy about letting us know when you spot one, we're always grateful. Given that the game now contains roughly fifty-one thousand words of dialog and there's only one person on the writing team, a few woopsies are inevitable so any help in spotting them is, well... helpful!New Content Notificat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T15:52:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055882922","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4742500-1838407329264622","game_id":"steam-4742500","kind":"update","title":"Small Update - Performance Improvements, Bugfixes, More Dialog!","summary":"Greetings investigators!Todays' quick update is just to add:Playback performance improvements for tutorial videosAfter watching some playthroughts online I realized our sweet new video tutorials were so laggy they might as well still be still images! So I did some digging and discovered every single tutorial video was starting and looping playback simultaneously whenever you watched one of them. Obviously not the intended behaviour, so that's been fixed!Jotpad position storage resets if you take","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T02:58:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329264622","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4742500-1837955055360155","game_id":"steam-4742500","kind":"announcement","title":"Tutorial Overhaul","summary":"Greetings investigators! We have another update for you that should help smooth out some of the early game onboarding wrinkles. The tutorial popups have been revamped to replace the static images with nice, easily understood video explanations of how the mechanics of the game work. It also allowed us to consolidate the Jotpad tutorial from a five part explanation to a three part explanation. A picture may be worth a thousand words but three videos easily replace five pictures! If you ever need t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-11T22:08:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055360155","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4742500-1837955055357608","game_id":"steam-4742500","kind":"update","title":"Small Patch: Drag Ideas To Jotpad & Brainstorming Faster!","summary":"Small Patch: Idea Dragging ImprovementsHello investigators! Thank you so much to everybody who has checked out the demo so far! Every single download means the world to our small little team of two, and we're gathering any and all feedback folks have on how to make both the demo and the main game even better. Today's small patch features a little quality of life update to help streamline moving ideas around between your Casebook and your Jotpad.You can now:Drag an idea from the dialog records pa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-10T17:39:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055357608","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4742500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:52Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:51Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4742500":"2026-10-26T14:05:52Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4742500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:51Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:51Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:51Z"},"4852420":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:52Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:52Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:52Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4742500","app_id":4742500,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:54Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"ec7bf29aebddd3c1cfb54b818ca1a36cfeba26525f0c4a048654abb3e6764a18","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Six witnesses, six suspects, and thousands of discoverable lines of dialog. You're the fantasy detective on the case of a stolen magical artifact, and in order to determine the truth you'll have to cross examine, interrogate, and reference all your resources to catch the thief before time runs out.","publishers":[{"name":"Triple Cerberus Studios"}],"developers":[{"name":"Triple Cerberus Studios"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793365380,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Edi